<title>USA: ITT Industries Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>ITT Industries Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>FOURTH QUARTER	 TOTAL YEAR</p>
<p>				   1996	 1995*     1996    1995*</p>
<p> Total Sales		$2,231.2   $2,251.3 $8,718.1 $8,884.2</p>
<p> Operating Income	    141.8	109.2    508.4    446.2</p>
<p> Net Income		     71.2	 33.4    222.6    185.0</p>
<p> Avg shrs outstanding	120.6	117.9    120.4    117.7</p>
<p> Earnings per share	   0.59	 0.28     1.85     1.57</p>
<p>			  (In millions, except per share)</p>
<p>		 * Adjusted to exclude one-time charges</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q4 net income above excludes $49.6 million of charges associated with the disposition of non-strategic assets. Including charges, it was a net loss of $16.2 million.  </p>
<p>The Q4 EPS results of $0.59 beat First Call analysts' consensus of $0.58 by a penny.</p>
</text>
